<body>
    <%- include('partials/header') %>

    <section id="contact" class="contact-section">
        <div class="about-us-box">
            <h3>About us</h3>
            <p>BeTranslator is a professional translation agency staffed by native-speaking linguists and industry specialists. We provide certified and non-certified translations across legal, medical, technical and marketing domains, combining subject-matter expertise with rigorous quality checks and strict confidentiality.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="our-mission-box">
            <h3>Our Mission</h3>
            <p>Our mission is to make accurate, culturally appropriate translations accessible to businesses and individuals. We focus on preserving meaning and tone, delivering reliable turnaround times, transparent pricing and responsive project support.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="contact-info-box">
            <h3>Contact Details</h3>
            <ul class="contact-info-list">
                <li><strong>Address:</strong> LC 152/4 , Raiwind Road, Lahore, Pakistan</li>
                <li><strong>Phone:</strong> <a href="tel:+923001234567">+92 300 1234567</a></li>
                <li><strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:info@betranslator.com">info@betranslator.com</a></li>
                <li><strong>Hours:</strong> Mon–Fri 09:00–18:00</li>
            </ul>
            <div class="social-links">
                <a href="#" aria-label="Facebook" class="social">Facebook</a>
                <a href="#" aria-label="Twitter" class="social">Twitter</a>
                <a href="#" aria-label="LinkedIn" class="social">LinkedIn</a>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="links-box">
            <h3>Shortcut Links</h3>
            <ul>
                <li><a href="/services">Services</a></li>
                <li><a href="/about">About</a></li>
                <li><a href="/languages">Languages</a></li>
                <li><a href="/testimonials">Testimonials</a></li>
                <li><a href="/contact">Contact</a></li>
            </ul>
        </div>
